# Line endings are LF in this repository, on every platform, without exception.
#
# This library contains GENERATED code — Languages.Tables.g.cs is written from catalogs/languages.json
# and carries that file's SHA-256 — and generated code is compared, not just read: the build refuses
# to compile when the recorded hash no longer matches the catalogue, and the generator has a --check
# mode that compares the file it would write against the file on disk.
#
# Anything that lets the same content have two byte representations turns those comparisons into
# coin flips that depend on whose machine ran them. That already happened once, in the catalogue
# repository, and it made the project unbuildable anywhere `core.autocrlf` was not set.
* text=auto eol=lf
